Local codec checkpoint extensions

bandlimit 0.1.7 retains local versioned resampler state save/restore methods.
Its original codec licenses remain in vendor/bandlimit/. syom uses unmodified
upstream 0.10.0 candidate source pinned by Cargo.lock, including its upstream
persistent AAC-LC state API. The MIT license for the retained syom test fixture
is also preserved at vendor/licenses/syom-MIT.txt. No runtime crate is added.
See docs/syom-upstream.md and docs/storage-and-recovery.md for the state contract.


TLS key-exchange adapter reference

The fallible client adapter in src/download/tls/kx.rs follows the ECDH glue
structure from RustCrypto/rustls-rustcrypto at revision
70f76c039e587192688af18a80d5d6435dedaf22, adapted to propagate entropy errors
and retain client-only ownership. Its upstream MIT notice is retained below.

https://github.com/RustCrypto/rustls-rustcrypto

